verwritten by a misanchored edit (restored, and the edit moved to §1.4). A count in Theorem 1.11(b)–(c) was one short and the canonical form of 0 was misstated (fixed; conclusions unchanged). The §0 summary labels now match the status table. The kings/ side session wrote these fixes. Two Sonnet reviewers read the first draft, which led to the correction of the audit's reading of 2.10(a). Two more read the revised text, and their remaining wording points were applied. K3 saw none of them, and its SOUND verdicts on 1.11(b) and 2.10(a) predate them. |
