kings/delegate/out/K11/REPORT.md:60:| Step 2 (invariants Jβ, Jω, I1) | SOUND | Checked under push, double step, capture landing in the strip (from outside or within), capture leaving the strip, and the e.p. capture offered at y. The e.p. capturer after a double step would need rank ρ_p, forbidden by (Jβ); (H4) bounds captures of β pawns on neighbouring files. |
kings/delegate/out/K11/REPORT.md:61:| Step 3 (p never captured) | SOUND | Follows from (Jω) and (I1); includes the e.p. case after p's own double step. |
