- both have one (a race, scored by the count rule): b = N if dp(N) ≤ dp(M), else b = M, where dp is
  `promote_distance`.

Then (V2) holds at y′ if (H1)–(H5) hold at (y′, s = N, β = b) for some pawn p of b. Then e = d if b = M (the
